{
"file": 1017,
"paths": [
"d008/d132/f018"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "e934d82c",
"en_raw": "Hey, Melos!"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "f4597960",
"en_raw": "What a terrible smell..."
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "1c4b61e9",
"en_raw": "It can't be helped behind the toilet"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "52279cc0",
"en_raw": "and what else is it"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "172e77b1",
"en_raw": "It smells like Melos's doghouse"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "4efb1ad2",
"en_raw": "Huh?"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "363cca79",
"en_raw": "I thought it was a parabolic antenna"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "da7979e6",
"en_raw": "but no..."
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "94d2a2b7",
"en_raw": "An umbrella and a wok...?"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "5ad17fd5",
"en_raw": "Why would anyone put up something like this..."
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "a9f225a8",
"en_raw": "...There's a person inside"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "acdb844e",
"en_raw": "Uh-oh... let's go home"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "4bdaecb0",
"en_raw": "...Ah!?"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "16a4c19b",
"en_raw": "Ah, by the way,"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "2d17d317",
"en_raw": "it seems the creature from yesterday isn't here?"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "79ae1ccf",
"en_raw": "Yesterday's creature?"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "c03a63da",
"en_raw": "Um..."
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "896c3bb8",
"en_raw": "Ah, it's you"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "b968b048",
"en_raw": "Good, good"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "958f15f8",
"en_raw": "You haven't brought that creature"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "25f3b429",
"en_raw": "the one pretending to be your servant"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "89dc08ca",
"en_raw": "That scary one, you know"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "6f2eb25a",
"en_raw": "Don't say you don't know"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "eb3dadc9",
"en_raw": "The one with fangs,"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "fa938906",
"en_raw": "oh, how frightening..."
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "59a5d64e",
"en_raw": "...You mean Melos?"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "a8dc92ce",
"en_raw": "Then he really was inside"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "7a711e0b",
"en_raw": "here yesterday, too?"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "03942332",
"en_raw": "Sorry"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "22468af1",
"en_raw": "But Melos barking at people"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "ff02a668",
"en_raw": "is"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "f67459b2",
"en_raw": "really rare"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "7b7d6434",
"en_raw": "It's our natural enemy,"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "269460c5",
"en_raw": "you see"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "06a9240d",
"en_raw": "From the Kinko star system"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "a95bdd78",
"en_raw": "by the hands of the Kinkodals,"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "716f25fd",
"en_raw": "it was genetically"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "dd4cdfe2",
"en_raw": "modified, a creature"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "e7be7168",
"en_raw": "made to detect"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "edd0b5b8",
"en_raw": "us Kapras people"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "eda75ec6",
"en_raw": "Yes... a biological weapon"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "85505889",
"en_raw": "No way"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "ca54cc1b",
"en_raw": "He's just a mutt"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "84965ea1",
"en_raw": "\"No way\" won't do,"
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "061d3c5f",
"en_raw": "Earth boy"
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "76c4f612",
"en_raw": "Truth always moves"
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "2f533acb",
"en_raw": "outside your common sense"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "7c0b00ec",
"en_raw": "Now, go on"
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "76c4f612",
"en_raw": "Truth always moves"
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "2f533acb",
"en_raw": "outside your common sense"
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "9e1b6de5",
"en_raw": "Whoa, it smells like a zoo..."
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "5bcd5cf9",
"en_raw": "Now, Earth boy"
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "894cdf85",
"en_raw": "...Y-yes?"
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "c03a63da",
"en_raw": "Um..."
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "f107a561",
"en_raw": "Until now, have you"
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "feba0aef",
"en_raw": "ever been hit by strong dizziness"
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "4c4b4f17",
"en_raw": "or had sudden memory gaps"
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "bd3c208f",
"en_raw": "or anything?"
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "911387b0",
"en_raw": "Probably not..."
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "797b4d74",
"en_raw": "Oh, oh, good"
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "4d258eb6",
"en_raw": "You're fortunately still"
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "a71a4f91",
"en_raw": "unexposed to the Kinkodal"
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "d5a98d45",
"en_raw": "brainwashing ray"
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "0dfd30f9",
"en_raw": "But be careful"
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "af71181c",
"en_raw": "They're always targeting"
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "bfcf980a",
"en_raw": "Earthlings like you"
},
{
"n": 66,
"h": "61faac7c",
"en_raw": "...With a machine like a ballpoint pen"
},
{
"n": 67,
"h": "0b5f7c88",
"en_raw": "they flash it, and then"
},
{
"n": 68,
"h": "80c25b00",
"en_raw": "the Earthling's memory is erased"
},
{
"n": 69,
"h": "22ef9a80",
"en_raw": "and they become"
},
{
"n": 70,
"h": "bd54b66a",
"en_raw": "a Kinkodal minion"
},
{
"n": 71,
"h": "c8be3d0c",
"en_raw": "...Huh"
},
{
"n": 72,
"h": "a3017eb4",
"en_raw": "TV is dangerous too"
},
{
"n": 73,
"h": "61010a90",
"en_raw": "...I used to be"
},
{
"n": 74,
"h": "abf46b59",
"en_raw": "at a TV station"
},
{
"n": 75,
"h": "4b79b8fa",
"en_raw": "but that place is"
},
{
"n": 76,
"h": "cb4a9b47",
"en_raw": "completely occupied by the Kinkodals"
},
{
"n": 77,
"h": "767a2292",
"en_raw": "Bathed in TV waves"
},
{
"n": 78,
"h": "51822115",
"en_raw": "you're slowly brainwashed"
},
{
"n": 79,
"h": "3764dd8c",
"en_raw": "......"
},
{
"n": 80,
"h": "b5850690",
"en_raw": "With special glasses"
},
{
"n": 81,
"h": "c419bc85",
"en_raw": "you can see through their disguises, but..."
},
{
"n": 82,
"h": "cf44c350",
"en_raw": "Well, go on"
},
{
"n": 83,
"h": "90956487",
"en_raw": "...Ah, yes"
},
{
"n": 84,
"h": "e62ebe2d",
"en_raw": "What is it?"
},
{
"n": 85,
"h": "f037a966",
"en_raw": "Frankly, you're a good Earthling"
},
{
"n": 86,
"h": "431df8f8",
"en_raw": "Oh..."
},
{
"n": 87,
"h": "b11a7319",
"en_raw": "Frankly, it's a pity"
},
{
"n": 88,
"h": "fa12440b",
"en_raw": "A pity... what is?"
},
{
"n": 89,
"h": "d5857011",
"en_raw": "Oh, oh, sorry"
},
{
"n": 90,
"h": "aeead3e2",
"en_raw": "If only I had power..."
},
{
"n": 91,
"h": "c06e4423",
"en_raw": "If only I'd noticed"
},
{
"n": 92,
"h": "35679fb7",
"en_raw": "a little sooner"
},
{
"n": 93,
"h": "3d076a3e",
"en_raw": "Please don't be so down"
},
{
"n": 94,
"h": "fc806fbf",
"en_raw": "...Oh, yes, you're right"
},
{
"n": 95,
"h": "c5064c24",
"en_raw": "It's too soon to give up hope"
},
{
"n": 96,
"h": "78189d8a",
"en_raw": "That's right, if relief from the home star arrives"
},
{
"n": 97,
"h": "488c1d17",
"en_raw": "the future of this planet"
},
{
"n": 98,
"h": "6155f0ce",
"en_raw": "might change"
},
{
"n": 99,
"h": "b3e5340f",
"en_raw": "...Y-yes, haha"
},
{
"n": 100,
"h": "0275c3c6",
"en_raw": "Eventually, I may have to"
},
{
"n": 101,
"h": "d26e472c",
"en_raw": "borrow your power too"
},
{
"n": 102,
"h": "016fbbcd",
"en_raw": "I'm counting on you then"
},
{
"n": 103,
"h": "a359b0aa",
"en_raw": "Ah, y-yes..."
},
{
"n": 104,
"h": "9fe40d28",
"en_raw": "Oh, oh, boy of Earth"
},
{
"n": 105,
"h": "f9fb29c7",
"en_raw": "There's something I want to ask you"
},
{
"n": 106,
"h": "c03a63da",
"en_raw": "Um..."
},
{
"n": 107,
"h": "9fe40d28",
"en_raw": "Oh, oh, boy of Earth"
},
{
"n": 108,
"h": "f9fb29c7",
"en_raw": "There's something I want to ask you"
},
{
"n": 109,
"h": "a04d50e8",
"en_raw": "...What is it?"
},
{
"n": 110,
"h": "54616cb0",
"en_raw": "It's none other than"
},
{
"n": 111,
"h": "24251245",
"en_raw": "Princess Bon"
},
{
"n": 112,
"h": "0301f81a",
"en_raw": "Princess Bon... you mean"
},
{
"n": 113,
"h": "60b643e1",
"en_raw": "do you mean Shiina?"
},
{
"n": 114,
"h": "1aa498e2",
"en_raw": "We can't leave the Princess"
},
{
"n": 115,
"h": "e025d749",
"en_raw": "on this planet as is"
},
{
"n": 116,
"h": "c76d9190",
"en_raw": "This planet can no longer escape"
},
{
"n": 117,
"h": "0d0f7477",
"en_raw": "Kinkodal brainwashing"
},
{
"n": 118,
"h": "c155797d",
"en_raw": "Kinkodal brainwashing... what's that?"
},
{
"n": 119,
"h": "11ace3ce",
"en_raw": "Trends, theories, hard study,"
},
{
"n": 120,
"h": "c08f7828",
"en_raw": "anyway, a flood of"
},
{
"n": 121,
"h": "fbce4bda",
"en_raw": "massive information"
},
{
"n": 122,
"h": "893814f2",
"en_raw": "to scramble the brain"
},
{
"n": 123,
"h": "4a1b7a7f",
"en_raw": "so the truth can't be seen"
},
{
"n": 124,
"h": "f3a9b8b6",
"en_raw": "making all Kinkodal information"
},
{
"n": 125,
"h": "9317960e",
"en_raw": "feel like"
},
{
"n": 126,
"h": "62018424",
"en_raw": "reality"
},
{
"n": 127,
"h": "7e4d183f",
"en_raw": "Then, once the power to see"
},
{
"n": 128,
"h": "4b9ca23a",
"en_raw": "and feel things for yourself weakens"
},
{
"n": 129,
"h": "5774ca51",
"en_raw": "Kinkodal turns the planet's residents"
},
{
"n": 130,
"h": "fdd320f5",
"en_raw": "into slaves"
},
{
"n": 131,
"h": "0a07a6bd",
"en_raw": "...Terrible, isn't it?"
},
{
"n": 132,
"h": "44ee4671",
"en_raw": "Huh..."
},
{
"n": 133,
"h": "2cacb5e1",
"en_raw": "It used to target adults,"
},
{
"n": 134,
"h": "858b5754",
"en_raw": "but lately, because of the brainwashing waves"
},
{
"n": 135,
"h": "a4c8be41",
"en_raw": "brain degradation is very fast"
},
{
"n": 136,
"h": "1dc84b0f",
"en_raw": "so the targets are getting younger"
},
{
"n": 137,
"h": "d1cdbcba",
"en_raw": "Now, some Earth children"
},
{
"n": 138,
"h": "9e671b57",
"en_raw": "have begun to become Kinkodalized"
},
{
"n": 139,
"h": "8fab9a26",
"en_raw": "Somewhere, they"
},
{
"n": 140,
"h": "aa6b2414",
"en_raw": "watch it, grinning"
},
{
"n": 141,
"h": "3764dd8c",
"en_raw": "......"
},
{
"n": 142,
"h": "e26f7229",
"en_raw": "We have resisted such forces"
},
{
"n": 143,
"h": "3ed6c165",
"en_raw": "...But we couldn't get the vital"
},
{
"n": 144,
"h": "a11e0a77",
"en_raw": "cooperation of Earthlings"
},
{
"n": 145,
"h": "08ed584d",
"en_raw": "...We lost"
},
{
"n": 146,
"h": "e8fec60f",
"en_raw": "Soon, I will leave this planet"
},
{
"n": 147,
"h": "4d9ccc08",
"en_raw": "I called a Kapras rescue ship"
},
{
"n": 148,
"h": "f35b74a0",
"en_raw": "near here"
},
{
"n": 149,
"h": "d3a7e65f",
"en_raw": "If possible, I'd like to take"
},
{
"n": 150,
"h": "346a3caf",
"en_raw": "Princess Bon home too"
},
{
"n": 151,
"h": "1eb532ed",
"en_raw": "But Princess Bon..."
},
{
"n": 152,
"h": "89f8781d",
"en_raw": "She's an Earthling, Shiina is"
},
{
"n": 153,
"h": "4fefb141",
"en_raw": "Oh, oh,"
},
{
"n": 154,
"h": "ab095725",
"en_raw": "I understand your feelings well"
},
{
"n": 155,
"h": "6af6d178",
"en_raw": "But it can't"
},
{
"n": 156,
"h": "df3265f9",
"en_raw": "be done that way"
},
{
"n": 157,
"h": "bcbd56dd",
"en_raw": "There's a hilltop in this town, right?"
},
{
"n": 158,
"h": "d3063a04",
"en_raw": "The ship will come there"
},
{
"n": 159,
"h": "d02b9e3f",
"en_raw": "When night falls, you must"
},
{
"n": 160,
"h": "67e71c14",
"en_raw": "bring Princess Bon there"
},
{
"n": 161,
"h": "ab203125",
"en_raw": "Otherwise..."
},
{
"n": 162,
"h": "85cfe444",
"en_raw": "Otherwise, what?"
},
{
"n": 163,
"h": "485ebad0",
"en_raw": "...Our Kapras comrades"
},
{
"n": 164,
"h": "416c25c4",
"en_raw": "will use a bug bomb"
},
{
"n": 165,
"h": "07d820d5",
"en_raw": "Its power is"
},
{
"n": 166,
"h": "a980a0c8",
"en_raw": "a million times that of an Earth flea..."
},
{
"n": 167,
"h": "bde49598",
"en_raw": "That's absurd..."
},
{
"n": 168,
"h": "5190c403",
"en_raw": "Anyway, boy of Earth"
},
{
"n": 169,
"h": "5a9c07fa",
"en_raw": "Princess Bon to the hilltop!"
},
{
"n": 170,
"h": "6645febd",
"en_raw": "...You cannot"
},
{
"n": 171,
"h": "fc9e061d",
"en_raw": "refuse this"
},
{
"n": 172,
"h": "6645febd",
"en_raw": "...You cannot"
},
{
"n": 173,
"h": "fc9e061d",
"en_raw": "refuse this"
},
{
"n": 174,
"h": "88a9ebb7",
"en_raw": "...Excuse me"
},
{
"n": 175,
"h": "80036c06",
"en_raw": "Huh...?"
},
{
"n": 176,
"h": "2160ffd2",
"en_raw": "He's gone..."
}
]
}